       "<Figure size 1300x700 with 2 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "grid = Grid(filename=\"/anvil/scratch/x-smaticka/forcing/Iceland/Iceland3_grid.nc\")\n",
    "grid.plot()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3b147712-4a9e-4913-9ca9-c66e85309508",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Calculate `eta` and `beta`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "505dd6ed-3f1e-4149-adc4-2307b51d27c4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Using an asterisk wildcard, we load in 9 daily files for each history and bgc files:"
   ]
  },
  {
