  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "db237c94-f707-4528-be11-e4684e3cd095",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Here we see lower values of `beta` and elevated `eta` values near the inlets where there are rivers. "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "97f7c76a-844d-4b7e-8ff4-c2048d129f05",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We can plot the temperature and salinity and see that there is cooler fresher water in the same regions:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "id": "2dee79e8-79b9-4008-b1bf-cec31eb76e9e",
   "metadata": {},
